---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PostCard from '../components/PostCard.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { getPosts } from '../lib';
const posts = (await getPosts()).sort((a, b) => Number(b.data.featured) - Number(a.data.featured) || b.data.date.valueOf() - a.data.date.valueOf());
const tags = [...new Set(posts.flatMap(post => post.data.tags))];
---
<Base>
  <section class="home-hero">
    <div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> 一个持续生长的个人博客</div><h1>记录，<br />让思考<span class="hero-emphasis">有迹可循。</span></h1><p>在科学与日常之间，收集值得停留的想法。<br class="desktop-break" />写下一些观察，也留下一些问题。</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">关于这个角落 <Icon name="arrow" size={17} /></a></div>
    <div class="hero-note" aria-hidden="true"><div class="note-index">FIELD NOTES <span>NO. 001</span></div><svg class="orbit-art" viewBox="0 0 300 200" fill="none"><ellipse cx="151" cy="98" rx="102" ry="40" transform="rotate(-28 151 98)"/><ellipse cx="151" cy="98" rx="102" ry="40" transform="rotate(32 151 98)"/><ellipse cx="151" cy="98" rx="40" ry="94" transform="rotate(4 151 98)"/><circle cx="151" cy="98" r="23" class="orbit-core"/><circle cx="67" cy="115" r="5" class="orbit-dot"/><circle cx="209" cy="151" r="4" class="orbit-dot"/><circle cx="158" cy="12" r="4" class="orbit-dot"/><path d="M147 98h8m-4-4v8" class="orbit-cross"/></svg><p>慢一点，想深一点。</p><small>STAY CURIOUS. KEEP EXPLORING.</small><span class="note-corner"></span></div>
  </section>
  <div class="home-content">
    <section aria-labelledby="articles-title"><div class="section-top"><h2 id="articles-title">最近的文字 <span>{String(posts.length).padStart(2, '0')}</span></h2><a href="/archive/">全部归档 <Icon name="arrow" size={16} /></a></div><div class="post-list">{posts.map((post, index) => <PostCard post={post} index={index} />)}{!posts.length && <div class="empty-state"><Icon name="book" size={32} /><h3>这里，等一个新想法。</h3><p>第一篇文章正在路上。</p></div>}</div></section>
    <aside class="home-aside"><div class="aside-section"><span class="aside-label">HELLO, I'M DOBBY</span><div class="avatar-mark">d<span>·</span></div><h2>你好，我是 Dobby。</h2><p>对世界保持好奇。<br />在这里记录学习、思考，<br />以及生活中的细小发现。</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">认识一下 <Icon name="arrow" size={15} /></a></div><div class="aside-section"><div class="aside-heading"><h3>沿着主题探索</h3><span>TOPICS</span></div><div class="topic-list">{tags.map(tag => <a href={`/tags/${encodeURIComponent(tag)}/`}><span>{tag}</span><span>{posts.filter(post => post.data.tags.includes(tag)).length.toString().padStart(2, '0')} <Icon name="arrow" size={14} /></span></a>)}</div></div><a class="subscribe-note" href="/rss.xml"><Icon name="rss" size={20} /><div><strong>让文字慢慢抵达</strong><p>通过 RSS，订阅新的记录。</p></div><Icon name="arrow" size={16} /></a></aside>
  </div>
</Base>
